ANALYTICS STANDARD (DO NOT DEVIATE)

We use Google Analytics 4 with Measurement ID: G-LF2J4B0JKW.

Analytics must be loaded via a shared file:
- frontend/js/analytics.js

That file contains the GA4 gtag snippet.
All HTML pages MUST include:
<script src="/js/analytics.js"></script>

No page should embed GA inline directly.
No future page should omit this script.

Any new HTML page added to the site must include analytics.js.
This ensures analytics is automatically applied to all current and future pages.